dated": 1779578469, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226258152", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207062004", "personaname": "Bacon Omelette", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/123398138/", "num_games_owned": 300, "num_reviews": 115, "playtime_forever": 3306, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3306, "last_played": 1779572234, "avatar": "124a17584d5e40e6fc17965d43296518fcbb783e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alright, this was a bit longer than I imagined but finally done. I actually don't hate it. This is honestly a good game. Of course it doesn't come close to the narrative and dialogue qualities of the original Mass Effect games it's still pretty good on its own. \r\n\r\nThere are negatives of course, like the awkward facial animations and weird annoying dialogues here and there. A lot of bugs but not game breaking. Had to use a bunch of mods to make it more playable. Also, I didn't like design of the aliens in the game at all. Like what happened to the Asari and Turians. Especially Asari, they look really weird... maybe the shapes of their facial structures? It's weirdly smooth and round. Also, didn't really like the Turian legs. Krogans had that weird washed out faces too. Definitely some weird choices there.\r\n\r\nBut overall, this is a fun game. I liked it despite everything. Don't play this right after completing original series though. Be open minded and be patient with this game and you will probably like it.", "timestamp_created": 1779572791, "timestamp_updated": 1779572791, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.600647330284118652", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "recei